<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>how could you question my love for u</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">LOVERCORE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0GJ8b6dOPcTj7AY40kXQg0</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.640" end="00:17.080">How could you question my love for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.080" end="00:20.460">What would it take to be enough for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.460" end="00:25.010">How could you feel so strange in my arms?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.010" end="00:27.350">Oh, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.350" end="00:30.770">How could you question the way I feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.770" end="00:34.200">What would it take for me to make it real?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.200" end="00:38.720">How could you feel so strange in my arms?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.720" end="00:41.920">Oh, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.920" end="00:45.270">You used to be my doll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.270" end="00:48.770">You used to be my ball and chain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.770" end="00:52.040">Tell me what's on your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.040" end="00:55.310">And try not to lie right to my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.310" end="00:59.100">'Cause I just wanna catch your smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.100" end="01:02.540">I just wanna ride light your fire again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.540" end="01:05.880">You just wanna see me burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.880" end="01:09.270">Sorry that I don't excite you, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.270" end="01:12.790">'Cause even when I touch you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.790" end="01:16.120">You don't even wanna lately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.120" end="01:19.680">Remember, used to drive you crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.680" end="01:27.680">I'm just feeling crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.990" end="01:39.420">How could you question my love for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.420" end="01:42.840">What would it take to be enough for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.840" end="01:47.400">How could you feel so strange in my arms?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.400" end="01:49.730">Oh, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.730" end="01:53.160">How could you question the way I feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.160" end="01:56.570">What would it take for me to make it real?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.570" end="02:01.100">How could you feel so strange in my arms?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.100" end="02:02.810">Oh, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.810" end="02:06.250">So don't you be alarmed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.250" end="02:09.640">By my broken heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.640" end="02:13.350">You used to be my star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.350" end="02:17.150">And I'm just not ready to lose you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.150" end="02:20.640">How could you question my love for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.640" end="02:24.060">What would it take to be enough for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.060" end="02:28.530">How could you feel so strange in my arms?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.530" end="02:30.880">Oh, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.880" end="02:34.330">How could you question the way I feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.330" end="02:37.750">What would it take for me to make it real?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.750" end="02:42.330">How could you feel so strange in my arms?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.330" end="02:46.330">Oh, my love</p></div></body></tt>